        {
            "+content": "After resolving the disturbances in the imperial court, Kou Reirin and Shu Keigetsu begin to understand each other despite their contrasting backgrounds. When the two attend the autumn Harvest Festival in the southern lands ruled by the Shu clan, an unexpected incident causes their bodies to be switched once again. As preparations fall into chaos and Reirin is abducted, Reirin’s two overprotective brothers Kou Keikou and Kou Keishou get involved and the situation heads in an unexpected direction, Keigetsu must confront a new conspiracy threatening to implicate her.",
